  "open_questions": [
    "Исследуйте устройство образца S17 и его окружение. Сохраняйте найденные объекты, связи, основания и открытые вопросы. Различайте наблюдения, сообщения источников и гипотезы. Порядок, число объектов и глубина разбиения не заданы.",
    "What does doc:references@1 report about material P-A responses, and can it constrain S17's coating?",
    "Do the reported instrument limits (resolvable step 5 units, tolerance 0.001, non-unique composition) constrain how S17 observations may be interpreted?",
    "What is S17's internal radial structure, and how does the ~125 um external boundary relate to any coating or core?",
    "What are V04 and U09, and how do temperature and material_response of U09 interact with S17?",
    "Does S17's radial profile vary with axial position x, and is the ~125 um boundary uniform along the length?",
    "Is the contrast drop at ~125 um a coating boundary, and can material_response at U09 distinguish the coating material?",
    "Are there any internal layers below the 5-unit resolvable step that the radial_profile instrument cannot resolve?",
    "What does material_response at S17 radii report about internal composition or layers, and does it match any reference material?",
    "What effective path or medium does the constant 5.0 ns delay imply, given that the internal pulse path is not observed?",
    "What changes in S17, V04 and U09 observations at 40 C (state-1) and after return to 20 C (state-2)?",
    "Can material_response sample the ~125 um boundary region at all, given that the available radii are 2, 20 and 90 um?",
    "Does the resolved 0.01 ns delay increase at 40 C indicate a temperature-dependent path or medium, given that the internal pulse path is not observed?",
